OL,3,GNEWSANew baby bank 'open to everybody'
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe lead volunteer of a new baby bank,
OL,6,Fwhich gives away free children's
OL,7,Fproducts to those in need, says it is
OL,8,F"open to everybody".
OL,10,FThe Newent hub of Forest of Dean Baby
OL,11,FBank at The Ark Cafe in Newent,
OL,12,FGloucestershire, offers everything from
OL,13,Fbaby wipes and breast pumps to hats and
OL,14,Fswimwear, and can also source larger
OL,15,Fitems like cots from a warehouse in
OL,16,FCinderford.
OL,18,FHelen Carter, lead volunteer, says no
OL,19,Fone will be means tested, with parents
OL,20,Foften picking up new items while
OL,21,Fdonating what no longer fits their
OL,22,Fchild.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
