OL,3,GNEWSANew baby bank 'open to everybody'
OL,4,
OL,5,FKylie, a Newent mum visiting the baby
OL,6,Fbank, said: "It's always expensive to
OL,7,Fbuy new baby things and food and
OL,8,Fnappies and wipes. So to have the
OL,9,Fsupport locally is wonderful."
